#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Collapse-O-Matic"
msgstr "Collapse-O-Matic"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Collapse-O-Matic adds an [expand] shortcode that wraps content into a "
"lovely, jQuery collapsible div."
msgstr ""
"Collapse-O-Matic fügt einen [expand]-Shortcode hinzu, der Inhalte in ein "
"schönes, per jQuery ein- und ausklappbares Element einbettet."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "twinpictures, baden03"
msgstr "twinpictures, baden03"

