#: collapse-o-matic.php:637
msgid "Collapse Management"
msgstr "Collapse-Verwaltung"

#. translators: %1$s: opening link tag, %2$s: closing link tag.
#: collapse-o-matic.php:640 collapse-o-matic.php:837
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sCollapse Commander%2$s is an add-on plugin that introduces an advanced "
"management interface to better organize expand elements and simplify expand "
"shortcodes."
msgstr ""
"%1$sCollapse Commander%2$s ist ein Zusatz-Plugin, das eine erweiterte "
"Verwaltungsoberfläche einführt, um Expand-Elemente besser zu organisieren "
"und Expand-Shortcodes zu vereinfachen."

#: collapse-o-matic.php:648
msgid "Tag Attribute"
msgstr "Tag-Attribut"

#. translators: %1$s: opening link tag, %2$s: closing link tag.
#: collapse-o-matic.php:652
#, php-format
msgid ""
"HTML tag use to wrap the trigger text. See %1$sTag Attribute%2$s in the "
"documentation for more info."
msgstr ""
"HTML-Tag zum Umschließen des Trigger-Texts. Weitere Informationen finden "
"Sie in der Dokumentation unter %1$sTag-Attribut%2$s."

#: collapse-o-matic.php:659
msgid "Trigclass Attribute"
msgstr "Trigclass-Attribut"

#. translators: %1$s: opening link tag, %2$s: closing link tag.
#: collapse-o-matic.php:663
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Default class assigned to the trigger element. See %1$sTrigclass "
